        href: "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Server-sent_events",
        note: "文本流式输出常见的 SSE 协议模型。",
      },
      {
        label: "MDN WebSocket",
        href: "https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WebSocket",
        note: "双向实时通道和连接生命周期。",
      },
      {
        label: "Kubernetes pod lifecycle",
        href: "https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/workloads/pods/pod-lifecycle/",
        note: "readiness/liveness/startup probe 和滚动期间健康语义。",
      },
      {
        label: "Argo Rollouts",
        href: "https://argoproj.github.io/argo-rollouts/",
        note: "canary、blue-green、analysis 和 progressive delivery。",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: "security-sandbox",
    title: "安全、工具调用与沙箱",
    description: "这些资料支撑 prompt injection、MCP/Agent 工具风险、确认梯度、代码执行隔离和最小权限。",
    links: [
      {
        label: "OpenAI prompt injections",
        href: "https://openai.com/safety/prompt-injections/",
        note: "间接 prompt injection、用户控制和 consequential action 确认。",
      },
      {
        label: "Safety in building agents",
        href: "https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/agent-builder-safety",
        note: "agent prompt injection、structured outputs、tool approvals 和 trace graders。",
      },
      {
        label: "OpenAI MCP risk notes",
        href: "https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/tools-connectors-mcp",
        note: "connector/MCP 中的 prompt injection 和敏感工具调用风险。",
      },
      {
        label: "OWASP LLM Top 10",
        href: "https://owasp.org/www-project-top-10-for-large-language-model-applications/",
        note: "LLM01 prompt injection、excessive agency、sensitive information disclosure 等风险分类。",
      },
      {
        label: "OWASP MCP Top 10",
        href: "https://owasp.org/www-project-mcp-top-10/",
        note: "MCP 生命周期中的上下文欺骗、tool poisoning 和跨工具数据风险。",
      },
      {
        label: "Firecracker",
        href: "https://firecracker-microvm.github.io/",
        note: "microVM 隔离、快速启动和多租户执行环境。",
      },
      {
        label: "gVisor",
        href: "https://gvisor.dev/docs/",
        note: "容器 syscall 隔离和用户态内核沙箱。",
      },
    ],
  },
  {
    id: "interview-materials",
    title: "面试参考与用户给定材料",
    description: "这些资料用于理解问法和回答组织；分享页只作结构启发，不作为事实来源。",
    links: [
      {
        label: "Educative ChatGPT system design",
        href: "https://www.educative.io/blog/chatgpt-system-design",
        note: "公开面试文章，帮助理解 ChatGPT system design 常见讨论面。",
      },
      {
        label: "System Design Handbook",
        href: "https://www.systemdesignhandbook.com/guides/openai-system-design-interview/",
        note: "OpenAI 类系统设计面试的结构化参考。",
      },
      {
        label: "ByteByteGo",
        href: "https://bytebytego.com/",
        note: "Alex Xu / ByteByteGo system design 体系的高层结构和图解风格参考。",
      },
      {
        label: "ByteByteGo system design interview framework",
        href: "https://bytebytego.com/courses/system-design-interview/a-framework-for-system-design-interviews",
        note: "澄清需求、容量估算、高层设计、深挖和收尾的面试流程参考。",
      },
      {
        label: "用户给定分享页",
        href: "https://chatgpt.com/share/6a12503f-6804-83ea-ae9f-f9ef9583a9c9",
        note: "仅作容量估算、主链路和追问模板启发。",
      },
      {
        label: "用户补充分享页",
        href: "https://chatgpt.com/share/6a1252ac-1268-83ea-9a0a-e178b05f7b9f",
        note: "仅作查漏补缺和结构启发，不作为事实依据。",
