      <section id="request-flow" class="design-section">
        <p class="design-kicker">5. 请求链路</p>
        <h2>一条普通消息怎么变成流式回答</h2>
        <p>
          真实系统里，消息不是同步函数调用。它有身份、配额、状态、上下文、安全、队列、GPU 调度、
          流式传输和落库。面试时按这八步讲，基本不会漏主链路。
        </p>
        <div class="request-flow-note" aria-label="为什么请求不能设计成同步函数调用">
          <strong>为什么不能把 ChatGPT 设计成一个同步函数调用？</strong>
          <p>
            因为一次回答可能持续几十秒，用户会刷新或取消，GPU worker 可能重启，工具和代码执行可能比 HTTP 连接活得更久。
            如果状态只放在进程内存里，断线后就无法证明用户看过哪些 token；如果重试没有幂等键，就可能重复扣费、
            重复提交外部工具动作，或生成两条互相矛盾的回答。所以“请求链路”真正要设计的是一条可恢复的事件流，
            而不是一个从 controller 调 model 的函数。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="source-links source-links--compact" aria-label="请求链路章节引用来源">
          {requestFlowCitations.map((link) => (
            <a href={link.href} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
              <strong>{link.label}</strong>
              <span>{link.note}</span>
            </a>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="flow-grid">
          {flowSteps.map((card) => <DesignInfoCard card={card} />)}
        </div>

        <div class="stream-visual" aria-label="流式输出时序">
          <div class="stream-visual__title">
            Durable stream path: every user-visible delta is committed before it is flushed.
          </div>
          <div class="stream-step stream-step--accept">
            <b>1</b>
            <span>Accept</span>
            <strong>create response_id</strong>
            <p>auth, quota, idempotency_key and CREATED event commit before 202.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-step stream-step--context">
            <b>2</b>
            <span>Build context</span>
            <strong>history + files + tools</strong>
            <p>token budget, ACL, policy snapshot and trace_id are frozen for the run.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-step stream-step--infer">
            <b>3</b>
            <span>Inference</span>
            <strong>prefill -> decode</strong>
            <p>GPU queue, KV cache and cancel token define TTFT and TPOT.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-step stream-step--delta">
            <b>4</b>
            <span>Stream delta</span>
            <strong>seq + delta + heartbeat</strong>
            <p>relay flushes SSE/WebSocket events only after durable event append.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-step stream-step--done">
            <b>5</b>
            <span>Finalize</span>
            <strong>done / cancel / failed</strong>
            <p>final usage, finish_reason and canonical assistant message are materialized.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="stream-branch stream-branch--resume">
            <span>Retry / resume</span>
            <strong>Last-Event-ID + response_id + seq cursor</strong>
            <p>replay committed events; reject gaps and duplicate finalization.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-branch stream-branch--pressure">
            <span>Backpressure</span>
            <strong>client slow -> relay buffer -> scheduler signal</strong>
            <p>pause, shrink batch, shed new work or close stream with resumable state.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="stream-branch stream-branch--ledger">
            <span>Ledger & observability</span>
            <strong>usage_delta, final_usage, spans, audit</strong>
            <p>partial failure is visible through stream gap, outbox lag and missing final event.</p>
          </div>
          <svg class="stream-visual__lines" viewBox="0 0 1200 420" aria-hidden="true">
            <defs>
              <marker id="stream-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto">
                <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#2f6f9f" />
              </marker>
              <marker id="stream-side-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto">
                <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#a66a1f" />
              </marker>
            </defs>
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--main" d="M185 140 H252" marker-end="url(#stream-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--main" d="M425 140 H492" marker-end="url(#stream-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--main" d="M665 140 H732" marker-end="url(#stream-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--main" d="M905 140 H972" marker-end="url(#stream-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--side" d="M305 205 C250 240 210 265 185 300" marker-end="url(#stream-side-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--side" d="M785 205 C692 242 610 270 600 300" marker-end="url(#stream-side-arrow)" />
            <path class="stream-line stream-line--side" d="M1025 205 C1015 248 1012 278 1015 300" marker-end="url(#stream-side-arrow)" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="section-formula" aria-label="流式事件持久化不变量">
          <span>Visible stream invariant</span>
          <div set:html={requestDurabilityFormula} />
        </div>
        <p>
          这个不变量是本章的核心：客户端已经看到的每个 seq 都必须先成为 durable event；最终 assistant message
          只是事件日志重建出来的 canonical view。这样 relay 崩溃、浏览器断线、用户刷新、客户端 ack 丢失、
          duplicate seq 或 event gap 都能被同一套日志和状态机解释。
        </p>
        <div class="design-table-wrap" aria-label="Response 状态机和重试语义">
          <table class="design-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>问题</th>
                <th>设计</th>
                <th>关键语义</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {responseStateRows.map((row) => (
                <tr>
                  <td data-label="问题">{row.left}</td>
                  <td data-label="设计">{row.right}</td>
                  <td data-label="关键语义">{row.note}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p>
          普通聊天只是 P0。真实 ChatGPT 的请求还会分叉到文件、图片、语音、Apps、Agent、Code Executor、Canvas
          和后台研究。面试里不用把每个功能都画成独立大图，但要说清楚它们在同一条链路上哪里分叉、
          哪些对象必须先落库、哪里能异步、失败后如何恢复。
        </p>
        <div class="design-table-wrap" aria-label="ChatGPT 请求链路变体">
          <table class="design-table design-table--wide">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>产品面</th>
